  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You restore “life” to your damaged devices<br>\n<strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Life Sphere<sup>SOP</sup>, Technomancy Sphere</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use any Life Sphere ability which restores hit points to a creature on broken or damaged objects, restoring hit points to them as if they were creatures. If the object has the broken condition, this condition is removed if the object is restored to at least half its original hit points. This ability cannot restore warped or transmuted items, but it can still repair damage done to such items.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/technomancy\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
